   Health, Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY 29-31, 2009},
Organization = {Hunan Univ; Univ Hong Kong; Tsinghua Univ},
Abstract = {An experimental study on the air flow, throw, power upload and rotation
   speed is conducted. The impacts of outlet structure on the
   characteristics and jet properties are analyzed preliminarily. The
   following basic laws could be concluded. Rotation speed is proportional
   to the air volume, and power of the launcher is exponentially increase
   with the rotation speed. To calculate air flow and power, empirical
   formulas are deduced, the maximum errors are 0.95\% and 4.70\%
   respectively. Both of them are less than 5.00\% compared with the
   experimental values. The difference rates caused by the outlet angle are
   less than 5.00\%, which has little impact on air volume and fan power.
   The difference rate of power caused by outlet height is 3.12\%, which
   has little impact on fan power, either.},
