Abstract = {While much faith has been placed in the ability of market based
   solutions to allocate water entitlements efficiently, relatively little
   effort has been made in fostering trade between urban and rural sectors.
   One barrier has been concerns regarding the decline of rural communities
   following the trade of water out of rural areas. In this paper we
