   OF THE VIDIGAL SLUM IN RIO DE JANEIRO, BRAZIL},
Booktitle = {PROCEEDINGS OF THE 2ND INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ENERGY \&
   ENVIRONMENT: BRINGING TOGETHER ENGINEERING AND ECONOMICS},
