Abstract = {By using artificial water culture, transportation and accumulation of
   Sedum aizoon L. under heavy metals (copper, lead, zinc) stress were
   studied. The result showed that aizoon had a certain ability of
   accumulating heavy metals. When Cu2+ concentration was more than
   40umol/L, the enrichment of copper ability had reached to the level of
   hyperaccumulation plants did. Besides, when Pb2+ concentration was more
   than 60umol/L, the aboveground part saturated; while when Pb2+
   concentration was about 730 mg/kg, the underground part Pb2+ enrichment
   was increasing to the extent of Pb2+ concentration was 9600-16000 mg/kg.
   It will provide a new kind of material for phytoremediation applied in
   polluted environment.},
