Abstract = {The farmhouse is a kind of entertainment form for city residents to
   alleviate pressure on seeking, the customer satisfaction is helpful to
   enhance Agritainment service consciousness. In this paper, through the
   design of scale and field research, the evaluation system of
   agritainment customer satisfaction (RTCS) is constructed to study the
   customer satisfaction of agritainment and its influencing factors. The
   research results show that: in the five latent variables influence the
   farmhouse of customer satisfaction, customer feedback perceived the
   greatest impact on the farmhouse satisfaction, followed by the customer
   perception and customer perception of service facilities. And customer
   feedback in perceptual ``return{''}, ``recommended rate, the customer
   perception{''} facilities in the ``natural environment{''},
   ``architectural style{''}, ``illegal status, customer perception of
   service{''} of ``food taste{''}, ``employee cleanliness{''} observed
   variables to the latent variables effect more obvious, is the impact of
   the main factor of Agritainment in customer satisfaction. On the basis
   of the conclusion, the paper puts forward the countermeasures and
   suggestions to improve the satisfaction degree of agritainment.},
