   MANAGEMENT AND TECHNOLOGY(ICWMT 5)},
Year = {2010},
Pages = {607-610},
Note = {5th International Conference on Waste Management and Technology,
   Beijing, PEOPLES R CHINA, DEC 15-17, 2010},
Abstract = {As a promising environmental industry, contaminated soil remediation
   (CSR) has been given much attention in China both in academic research
   and commercial application. In order to promote the technologies of CSR
   in China, on the basis of more than 1595 scientific papers published in
   Chinese journals from 1996 to 2009, the chronological distribution of
   publications on CSR research groups, remediation medium and type of
   technology were analyzed. Research progresses related to each CSR
   process were summarized. Commercial CSR projects were also investigated.
   Finally, the demands for development in CSR technologies were projected.
   These demands included (1) rapid, land reusable CSR technologies
   consistent with China's industrial site conditions; (2) organic
   compounds and heavy metal combined contaminated soils should be paid
   more attention; (3) companies should take part in CSR industry actively.},
