   Freguete, Larissa Marques; Chu, Tianxing; Starek, Michael J., Texas A\&M Univ Corpus Christi, Conrad Blucher Inst Surveying \& Sci, 6300 Ocean Dr, Corpus Christi, TX 78412 USA.},
