Abstract = {Used products are fuzzy in technique state. In order to improve the
   degree of perception of reusable product and reduce the risk of buying,
   the method for assessment on risk of consumer's cognition of reusable
   product is proposed. The values of engineering characteristics and
   perception factors can be ascertained respectively from parts layer by
   means of inverse process approach of Quality Function Deployment. A
   mathematic model to measure customer perception according to the given
   engineering characteristic values is shown. It is proved that the
   current method is effective in helping consumer to evaluate the
   perceived risk of reusable product and make the correct choice by case
