   Univ Pittsburgh, Dept Psychiat, Pittsburgh, PA 15260 USA.
   Univ Pittsburgh, Sch Nursing, Pittsburgh, PA 15261 USA.
   Univ Pittsburgh, Inst Canc, Pittsburgh, PA 15261 USA.},
