   problems, then Raise up the approach of how to reinforce the path of the
   intensive use of suburban land: establishing the behavior of game of the
   intensive use of our suburban land, evaluation system of the intensive
   use of our suburban land, Intensive land use of innovative mechanism
   research-the homestead-changed-house, through those ways, strengthening
