Organization = {Hunan Univ; Univ Hong Kong; Tsinghua Univ},
Abstract = {The ecological environmental concerns has become the most important
   global issue, today, ecological crisis has stimulated the awakening of
   the public eco-environment awareness and improvement. Along with the
   growing awareness of environmental protection, human needs not only stop
   with a view to gaining more products, but also concern about the living
   quality of mankind as a whole and the living environment. Based on the
   thoughts of returning to nature, environmental protection and ecological
   balance as the purpose of consumption, people have better sense to buy
   the new eco-products for their own health and the living environment.
   Against the backdrop of the serious shortage of natural resources and
   timber in particular, eco-furniture emerged as people's necessity in
   order to protect ecological environment and resources without the
   detriment to the living environment. Based on eco-ethics and
   eco-aesthetics of non-anthropocentrism, this paper explores the
   connection of eco-furniture design and the living environment.
   Eco-furniture design infuses the thoughts of sustainable development
   into the product design process and links the ecological environment and
   economic development as a organized whole. As a result, eco-furniture
   design is the essential need for sustainable development of human
   society and living environment. This paper intents to guide one kind of
   brand-new design idea, initiate and call for reasonable, moderate and
   sustainable consumer confideness and culture of home furnishings on
   ecological ethics and aesthetics.},
