Abstract = {Performance Based Contract is the innovation in contracts at
   construction, that the payment system is based on contractor
   performance. In this contract, there are risks from both the
   contractor's and owner's perception. The aims of this study are to
   identify and analyze the risk from contractor's and owner's perception
   at Performance Based Contracts based on project life cycle. Primary data
   were taken through the questionnaire and interview, then processed using
   AHP (Analytical Hierarchy Process) method. The secondary data are the
   data in project and literature from previous studies. The identification
   of risks are reviewed by the project life cycle, and it is known that
   the risks of contractor's and owner's perception are different.},
