   Geophys; Chinese Acad Sci; Engn Technol Press},
Abstract = {Economy, society, environment and resource interact each other and
   constitute a complex system. Analytical hierarchy process (A HP) is a
   popular and powerful method for solving different problem of complex
   system. This paper presents an indicator system with hierarchical
   structure upon AHP to evaluate the status of sustainable development as
   an example for Shaoyang. In this research, we (1) discuss pathways in
   which to build a proper hierarchical structure, (2) describe the
   formulation of a AHP theory to predict the weight value of each
   indicator in lite hierarchical structure and (3) report model results
   based upon data about economy, society, environment and resource from
   2004-2007 in Shaoyang, China. The analysis result shows that the
   sustainable development status become better than before from 2004-2007.
   Comprehensive score of economy sub-system and environment sub-system
   keeps increasing, by contraries, the score of society sub-system and
   resource carry sub-system decreased slowly.},
